  m_text: 'WASD + mouse to move.

    Press 1-6 to toggle a station.

    All start
    OFF.


    1  Proximity Reveal (blue, left)

    2  Distance LOD (green, ahead)

    3 
    Gaze + Dwell (orange, right)

